'''Sakura Android''' (ハルドロイド, haru doroido, '''Spring Droid''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Droid Awakes!]]. It was added in [[Version 3.5 Update|Version 3.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Sakura Android
|image = E 157.png
|appearance = [[Droid Awakes!]]
|money drop = 2,000円 - 7,900円
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has rather high health, attack power and range. However, it has slow movement speed, attack rate and backswing, meaning you shouldn't have trouble keeping him in place.

==Strategy==
Anything that can outrange it like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] is strongly advised for fighting this foe.

